# P04_GCBudget repository: docs + the UE project in GCBudget/.
# Generated by Unreal / Visual Studio. Never commit.
GCBudget/Binaries/
GCBudget/Intermediate/
GCBudget/Saved/
GCBudget/DerivedDataCache/
GCBudget/Build/
GCBudget/Plugins/*/Binaries/
GCBudget/Plugins/*/Intermediate/
GCBudget/.vs/
GCBudget/*.sln
GCBudget/*.slnx
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.suo

# Python
__pycache__/

# Packaged builds stay out of git.
Build/

# Benchmarks: raw captures, run reports and logs stay local (too large for git; UE logs also hold
# machine-specific paths). Manifests and Summaries/ are committed; cited raw batches go to GitHub Releases.
Benchmarks/Raw/*
!Benchmarks/Raw/*_manifest.json
Benchmarks/*_console.txt

# Work in progress staged outside the build (code for later steps, doc drafts). Never committed.
_wip/
